  "interpretation": "The anonymous pairwise Gram representation remains numerically invariant under deep unitary transport, but the gradient-trained linear and complete degree-2 softmax readouts remain near chance even on the training set. This is a readout learning/optimization negative, not evidence of transport instability. Because the historical frame decision function is algebraically representable as a quadratic function of the anonymous Gram entries after fixed invertible channel mixing, the next experiment should isolate optimizer failure using a deterministic closed-form quadratic readout rather than increasing feature degree or returning to semantic demixing.",
